{"headword":"מָחָר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong>, used often as <strong>adv.</strong>, <strong>to-morrow, in time to come (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܚܰܪ</span>; prob. properly <em>time in front</em>, Kö<sup>ii. 263</sup>, cf. √, and Assyrian <em>maḫru</em>, <em>front</em>, often of time, though always of <em>former time, of old</em>, Dl<sup>HWB 402</sup><strong>)</strong>:—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>to-morrow</em> (the day following the <em>present</em> day),"},{"senses":[{"definition":"as subst. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:23\" href=\"/Exodus.16.23\">Ex 16:23</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁבָּתוֹן שַׁבַּת קֹדֶשׁ לְי׳ מָחָר</span> <em>to-morrow</em> is a sabbath, etc., <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.5\">1 S 20:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹדֶשׁ מָחָר</span> <em>to-morrow</em> is the new moon, v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.18\">18</a>; in <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם מָחָר</span> †<a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">Gn 30:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.1\">Pr 27:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.12\">Is 56:12</a>; in the idiom. phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּעֵת מָחָר</span> at the like of the time, (being) <em>to-morrow</em>, = <em>about to-morrow</em> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּ</span> <strong>1 a</strong>) †<a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:18\" href=\"/Exodus.9.18\">Ex 9:18</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.16\">1 S 9:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.12\">20:12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.2\">1 K 19:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.6\">20:6</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.1\">2 K 7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.6\">10:6</a>; and in <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמָחָר</span> †<a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:19\" href=\"/Exodus.8.19\">Ex 8:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמָחָר יִהְיֶה הָאֹת הַזֶּה</span>, = <em>for, against, to-morrow</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:6\" href=\"/Exodus.8.6\">Ex 8:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:18\" href=\"/Numbers.11.18\">Nu 11:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:13\" href=\"/Joshua.7.13\">Jos 7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:12\" href=\"/Esther.5.12\">Est 5:12</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as adv. acc. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:25\" href=\"/Exodus.8.25\">Ex 8:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:5\" href=\"/Exodus.9.5\">9:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מָחָר יַעֲשֶׂה י׳ הַדָּבָר הָזֶּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:4\" href=\"/Exodus.10.4\">10:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הִנְנִי מֵבִיא מָחָר אַרְבֶּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:9\" href=\"/Exodus.17.9\">17:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:5\" href=\"/Exodus.32.5\">32:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:25\" href=\"/Numbers.14.25\">Nu 14:25</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.9\">1 S 11:9</a> etc., <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:6\" href=\"/Joshua.11.6\">Jos 11:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מָחָר כָּעֵת הַזֹּאת</span>; opp. to <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיּוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:10\" href=\"/Exodus.19.10\">Ex 19:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיּוֹם וּמָחָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:18\" href=\"/Joshua.22.18\">Jos 22:18</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.12\">2 S 11:12a</a>; rhetorically, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.13\">Is 22:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי מָחָר נָמוּת</span>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>in future time</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:14\" href=\"/Exodus.13.14\">Ex 13:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי יִשְׁאָֽלְךָ בִנְךָ מָחָר לֵאמֹר</span> = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.20\">Dt 6:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:6\" href=\"/Joshua.4.6\">Jos 4:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:21\" href=\"/Joshua.4.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:24\" href=\"/Joshua.22.24\">22:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:27\" href=\"/Joshua.22.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:28\" href=\"/Joshua.22.28\">28</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיוֹם מָחָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">Gn 30:33</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB05301","strong_numbers":["4279"],"next_hw":"מָחֳרָת","prev_hw":"מחר","occurrences":"52","quotes":[],"GK":["4737"],"TWOT":["1185a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}